        <Pos>k__BackingField: {x: 18272, y: 20561}
        <Title>k__BackingField: <p>Intro Encounter</p>
        <RawContent>k__BackingField: <pre><code>if sword_locked</code></pre><p>Hello
          traveler! Allow me to teach you its secrets and refine your skill. It will
          cost you 40 Gold.</p><pre><code>elseif !sword_locked</code></pre><p>Ah,
          a seasoned fighter! How many tales does your blade whisper from its edge?</p><p></p><pre><code>endif</code></pre><p></p>
        <RuntimeContent>k__BackingField: 
        <ColorTheme>k__BackingField: cyan
